 Close←{
   ⍝ Using Confirm:
   ⍝ Confirm blocks. We can exit, or then close
     r←⍵.Document A.Confirm'Close' 'Are you sure you want to close?'
     r≢'Yes':0
     A.Close ⍵.Document
   ⍝ Using Prompt, Alert or a DialogBox:
   ⍝ In the call back OnCloseOK we explicly close
  ⍝   ⍵.Document A.Prompt'Close' 'Save as:' 'some text'(A.FQP'OnCloseOK') ⍝ (A.FQP 'OnCloseCancel')
   ⍝ In any case:
   ⍝ Result does not matter, thrown away
 }
